  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "明天我们有课吗？\n\nAnne：李老师，明天我们有课吗？\n李老师：明天上午和下午都有课。\nAnne：上午几点上课？\n李老师：八点四十分。\nAnne：下午呢？\n李老师：一点十分。\nAnne：好！明天我来上课。\n李老师：明天见！\nAnne：明天见！",
    "traditional": "明天我們有課嗎？\n\nAnne：李老師，明天我們有課嗎？\n李老師：明天上午和下午都有課。\nAnne：上午幾點上課？\n李老師：八點四十分。\nAnne：下午呢？\n李老師：一點十分。\nAnne：好！明天我來上課。\n李老師：明天見！\nAnne：明天見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do We Have Class Tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "Anne：李老师，明天我们有课吗？",
      "traditional": "Anne：李老師，明天我們有課嗎？",
      "pinyin": "1 lǐ lǎo shī míng tiān wǒ men yǒu kè ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: Teacher Li, do we have class tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李老师：明天上午和下午都有课。",
      "traditional": "李老師：明天上午和下午都有課。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lǎo shī míng tiān shàng wǔ hé xià wǔ dōu yǒu kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Li: Tomorrow, we have class both in the morning and in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "Anne：上午几点上课？",
      "traditional": "Anne：上午幾點上課？",
      "pinyin": "1 shàng wǔ jǐ diǎn shàng kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: What time is class in the morning?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李老师：八点四十分。",
      "traditional": "李老師：八點四十分。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lǎo shī bā diǎn sì shí fēn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Li: 8:40."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "Anne：下午呢？",
      "traditional": "Anne：下午呢？",
      "pinyin": "1 xià wǔ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: What about the afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李老师：一点十分。",
      "traditional": "李老師：一點十分。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lǎo shī yī diǎn shí fēn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Li: 1:10."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "Anne：好！明天我来上课。",
      "traditional": "Anne：好！明天我來上課。",
      "pinyin": "1 hǎo míng tiān wǒ lái shàng kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Anne: Okay! I’ll come to class tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "李老师：明天见！",
      "traditional": "李老師：明天見！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lǎo shī míng tiān jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher Li: See you tomorrow!"
    },
    {
